#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:5
msgid "Add new Folio"
msgstr "添加新组合"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating `folios`_ from `menu bar`_, `projects panel`_, "
"`folios tabs bar`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许从 `图幅 <folios_>`_，`菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`folios标签栏 <projects "
"panel_>`_ 创建 `follios <folios tabs bar_>`_，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:11
msgid "Add new folio from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏中添加新框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Add a folio** menu item to add a new `folio`_ to the "
"active `project`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **项目 > 添加一个 folio** 菜单项，将一个新的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 添加到活动的 `项目 <project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:21
msgid "Add new folio from projects panel"
msgstr "从项目面板中添加新框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:23
msgid "Right click on the `project`_ where a new `folio`_ should be added."
msgstr "右键点击 `项目 <project_>`_，其中应添加一个新的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click the option **Add a folio** to add a new `folio`_ to the `project`_."
msgstr "单击选项 **添加缩写** 添加新内容 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 页：1 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the `projects panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**"
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 没有显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:36
msgid "Add new folio from folios tabs bar"
msgstr "从 folios 标签栏添加新文件"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:38
msgid ""
"Click on the **Add folio** icon |folio-new| from right side of the `folios "
"tabs bar`_ to add a new `folio`_ to the active `project`_."
msgstr ""
"点击 **Add folio** 图标 |folio-new| 从 `folios tabs bar <folios tabs bar_>`_ "
"右侧，在活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 上添加一个新的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:40
msgid "folio-new"
msgstr "新胶片"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:43
msgid "Add new folio using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键添加新 folio"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:45
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:47
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + t`` to add a new `folio`_ to the active `project`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + t`` 在活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中添加一个新的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/add_folio.rst:51
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
